    "title": "Silver Alert issued for missing 87-year-old Dyersburg man - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBBJ Staff ,\n12 hours ago DYERSBURG, Tenn. (WBBJ) - A #TNSilverAlert has been issued on behalf of the Dyersburg Police Department for 87-year-old James Humphreys. He was last seen on July 4th, traveling to Arizona in a 2005 Ford F-350 with TN tag 924BBZV. James is 5′11″, 160 lbs., with blue eyes and gray hair.... Read full article",
